# Blanchwood Armor's "Forests you control" are the Aura controller's, not the enchanted creature's controller's (CR 109.5), and a Forest is any permanent
# with the Forest subtype as it is now (CR 305.6, 305.7, 611.3a). Bot1 enchants Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2) on turn 5 with Savannah, Tropical Island (nonbasic
# Forests) and a basic Forest, three Forests: +3/+3 makes it 5/5 (Bot2's two Forests would make it 4/4, all five 7/7, the basic Forest alone 3/3). On
# turn 7 Spreading Seas makes Bot1's basic Forest an Island, no longer a Forest (CR 305.7): two Forests, +2/+2, 4/4.

